    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are vertices of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>ABC</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>AB</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>BC</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>CA</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>ABC</mi></math> is equilateral.</p><p>Therefore, orthocentre and centroid will be same.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0076_e4415472471a.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 200px;\"/></p><p>Also, mid point of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>Similarly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
